ssed\", \"coverage-review-act\"],\n  \"context\": \"session-2026-03-28\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-43208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49325","text":"Always use "},{"id":"spn-49326","marks":["code"],"text":"transition_goal"},{"id":"spn-49327","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-49328","marks":["code"],"text":"update_goal"},{"id":"spn-49329","text":") for status changes — provides audit trail. Include "},{"id":"spn-49330","marks":["code"],"text":"reason"},{"id":"spn-49331","text":" and evidence in metadata."}]},{"id":"blk-43209","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49332","text":"Set progress"}]},{"id":"blk-43210","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.6, metadata: {\n  \"basis\": \"3 of 5 sub-goals completed\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-43211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49333","marks":["bold"],"text":"Progress benchmarks (base on evidence, not optimism):"}]},{"id":"blk-43212","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49334","text":"0.0 — not started"}]}],"id":"blk-43213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49335","text":"0.1-0.3 — early exploration, initial nodes stored"}]}],"id":"blk-43215","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49336","text":"0.3-0.5 — core knowledge captured, key sub-goals active"}]}],"id":"blk-43217","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49337","text":"0.5-0.7 — substantial coverage, most sub-goals done"}]}],"id":"blk-43219","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49338","text":"0.7-0.9 — near complete, verifying/testing"}]}],"id":"blk-43221","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43224","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49339","text":"1.0 — all criteria met"}]}],"id":"blk-43223","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list",